  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.12 Avoidance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.12 “Avoidance” means not impacting jurisdictional areas if there is a practicable alternative to the proposed project that would have less impact on the aquatic ecosystem or jurisdictional areas, so long as the alternative does not have other significant adverse environmental consequences and is consistent with 40 CFR 230.10(a).\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; ss by #12953, eff 12-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt100.html"
